197 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 166 0 R/T(Ry always likes to book online through available apps so that he can walk into a theater with ease. He booked in a known cinema app that provides a lot of benefits to their members and makes the process smoother. He made a purchase of a movie ticket along with some concessions with a discount percentage for being a consistent member of the app. He used his phone to book and the qr code that was needed to be presented in the counter was saved on the app itself. This is the most convenient option because you don't need to have to wait in line for physical copies of your tickets or wait in line along with other cinema goers who will only about to order their food on the counter but rather you only need to present the qr code that was provided when you purchased your ticket online.)/E(Ry always likes to book online through available apps so that he can walk into a theater with ease. He booked in a known cinema app that provides a lot of benefits to their members and makes the process smoother. He made a purchase of a movie ticket along with some concessions with a discount percentage for being a consistent member of the app. He used his phone to book and the qr code that was needed to be presented in the counter was saved on the app itself. This is the most convenient option because you don't need to have to wait in line for physical copies of your tickets or wait in line along with other cinema goers who will only about to order their food on the counter but rather you only need to present the qr code that was provided when you purchased your ticket online.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[5]>>
