376 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 177 0 R/E(The User dimension contains all persons who interact with our system, either directly or indirectly. This involves primary users, such as moviegoers and students \(our group personas Ryan and David\), who use the platform to see the movies, find seats, book a student ticket, and bring their e-tickets to the movie. It also includes cinema attendants at the entrance scanning the QR code and cinema manager who changes the movie list, adjusts movie seating and handles pricing.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

377 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 523 0 R/T(Users )/E(Users )/Pg 22 0 R/K[5]>>
