endobj

379 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 177 0 R/E(The Interface dimension refers to the way our product interacts with people, with other software programs, and with physical devices. The system has a responsive user interface for mobile apps and web browsers. It works with external payment gateways for digital wallets such as GCash and Maya, is connected to notification systems to email ticket receipts, and can connect to the bar code/QR code scanners used by cinema gatekeepers.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

