<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 179 0 R/T(The Environment dimension represents the physical environment, operating environments, and technology platforms needed for the system. The software is to be deployed on a cloud-server architecture with local device storage, and is to be accessible on Android, iOS and web browser platforms. The app is optimized for the physical space at the cinema where handheld scanners read mobile screens, particularly when it's dark.)/E(The Environment dimension represents the physical environment, operating environments, and technology platforms needed for the system. The software is to be deployed on a cloud-server architecture with local device storage, and is to be accessible on Android, iOS and web browser platforms. The app is optimized for the physical space at the cinema where handheld scanners read mobile screens, particularly when it's dark.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

397 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 179 0 R/T(7. Quality Attribute)/E(7. Quality Attribute)/Pg 24 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

398 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 179 0 R/E(The Quality Attribute dimension specifies the properties to which the whole system's performance, usability and reliability are measured. Movie listings loads in 3 seconds and seating maps in real time updates in 2 seconds. The interface is user friendly and dark with a cinematic theme and offline ticket caching ensures that users such as Ryan and David can retrieve their saved QR codes even when they are without mobile internet connection at the theater.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

